!Excluir puertas de enlace
ip dhcp excluded-address 172.26.31.254
ip dhcp excluded-address 172.26.37.126
ip dhcp excluded-address 172.26.37.254
ip dhcp excluded-address 172.26.38.126
ip dhcp excluded-address 172.26.37.190
!Excluir direcciones ip fijas en cada red
ip dhcp excluded-address 172.26.0.1 172.26.0.2
ip dhcp excluded-address 172.26.37.129
ip dhcp excluded-address 172.26.38.129
ip dhcp excluded-address 172.26.38.1
ip dhcp excluded-address 172.26.37.1

ip dhcp pool ESTUDIANTES
network 172.26.0.0 255.255.224.0
default-router 172.26.31.254
domain-name estudiantes.equipo4.com

ip dhcp pool LABORATORIOS_AE
network 172.26.37.0 255.255.255.128
default-router 172.26.37.126
domain-name laboratoriosAE.equipo4.com

ip dhcp pool LABORATORIOS_II
network 172.26.37.128 255.255.255.128
default-router 172.26.37.254
domain-name laboratoriosII.equipo4.com

ip dhcp pool SALAS_LECTURA_BB
network 172.26.38.0 255.255.255.128
default-router 172.26.38.126
domain-name salasLectura.equipo4.com

ip dhcp pool LABORATORIOS_IB
network 172.26.38.128 255.255.255.192
default-router 172.26.38.190
domain-name laboratoriosIB.equipo4.com
